    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Client sessions",
      "description": "Open client sessions per MDS. **Bad:** a sudden drop (clients evicted) or a steady climb (leaking mounts). **Fix:** `ceph tell mds.<name> session ls`.",
